# Build-context excludes for every crate's Containerfile (Dockerfile).
#
# Every service Containerfile in this monorepo builds from the
# REPOSITORY ROOT (not its own crate directory), because each crate's
# Cargo.toml depends on sibling crates by path — there is no root
# Cargo.toml / shared vendor step (agents/share/rust-loco-stack.md).
# Without this file, `podman build`/`docker build` would copy every
# crate's `target/` directory (multi-gigabyte build artifacts per
# crate, ~55 crates) into the build context, which is slow at best and
# has been observed to fail outright (`cannot allocate memory` copying
# extended attributes on a large `target/` tree).
#
# Podman prefers `.containerignore`; Docker only reads `.dockerignore`.
# Kept as two files with identical content (`.dockerignore` symlinked
# to this one) rather than one, so neither tool silently ignores it.
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/.svelte-kit/
**/dist/
**/build/
.git/
